WEBVTT

00:15.670 --> 00:18.500
I never dreamed before

00:18.500 --> 00:21.340
I'm gonna knock the door

00:21.340 --> 00:24.910
into the world of perfect free

00:24.910 --> 00:27.010
(You ain't no lonely!)

00:27.010 --> 00:29.850
You're gonna say I'm lying

00:29.850 --> 00:32.580
I'm gonna get the chance

00:32.580 --> 00:36.150
I thought a chance is far from me

00:36.150 --> 00:37.320
(You ain't no lonely!)

00:37.320 --> 00:40.230
I was made to hit in America

00:40.230 --> 00:43.090
(I was made to hit in America)

00:43.090 --> 00:49.000
I was made to hit in America

00:49.000 --> 00:52.670
You are the sun, you are the star

00:52.670 --> 00:54.670
(To me, forever)

00:54.670 --> 00:58.380
You are the sun, you are the star

00:58.380 --> 01:01.610
(To me, forever)

01:08.450 --> 01:14.060
I was made to hit in America

01:14.060 --> 01:16.900
I was made to hit in America

01:16.900 --> 01:19.760
(I was made to hit in America)

01:19.760 --> 01:22.570
I was made to hit in America

01:22.570 --> 01:25.340
(I was made to hit in America)

01:25.340 --> 01:33.210
I was made to hit in America

02:04.380 --> 02:08.210
"Knowing someone is reading this."
"Taitou Senior High School."
"Absolute Success!!"

02:10.380 --> 02:13.820
That cool song was requested
by radio listener, Suikaman,

02:13.820 --> 02:16.390
Neurofika's "Aikita."

02:16.390 --> 02:18.720
It's been awfully chilly lately, huh?

02:18.720 --> 02:22.730
To students studying for entrance exams,
please don't catch a cold.

02:22.730 --> 02:27.400
Our next request comes
from Yukio Tanaka in Tokyo.

02:27.400 --> 02:32.430
It's for you, Yukio.
"My World Down" by Dying Breed.

02:44.520 --> 02:47.550
Another minute

02:47.550 --> 02:50.150
Feelin' so fine

02:51.620 --> 02:52.520
You turn the freeze

03:10.880 --> 03:12.240
Creep!

03:14.710 --> 03:16.480
Are you all right?

03:18.550 --> 03:22.890
-Pervert!
-I'm okay, but my camera's dead.

03:22.890 --> 03:25.890
I wanted some bittersweet memories
of the days of my youth,

03:25.890 --> 03:27.730
so I had to take a bit of a risk...

03:27.730 --> 03:30.220
-Hey Tanabe!
-Huh?

03:31.230 --> 03:32.900
That rumor about Momo-chan...

03:32.900 --> 03:35.400
that she used to work part-time
in a cabaret club in college...

03:35.400 --> 03:37.170
Is it for real?!

03:37.170 --> 03:40.670
It bothers me so much
I can't study at all!

03:40.670 --> 03:43.340
Calm down guys.

03:43.340 --> 03:46.340
Give me a little more time to check it out.

03:46.340 --> 03:49.750
I'll find proof before graduation.

03:52.680 --> 03:55.020
I swear it on my grandpa's good name.

03:57.360 --> 04:00.690
Who's your grandpa?

04:00.690 --> 04:03.690
He's a railway employee.

04:03.690 --> 04:05.930
-Hmm...
-Hmm...
-Hmm...

04:05.930 --> 04:07.530
Let's go.

04:07.530 --> 04:08.520
-Yeah.
-Yeah.
-Yeah.

04:10.870 --> 04:12.460
A cabaret club, huh?

04:15.370 --> 04:18.840
And the one who got the idea for this

04:18.840 --> 04:22.710
was Franz Schubert of Austria.

04:22.710 --> 04:24.650
-And so...
-Huh?

04:25.880 --> 04:27.510
Tanaka-kun!

04:28.720 --> 04:31.220
Are you paying attention?

04:31.220 --> 04:32.220
Umm...

04:32.220 --> 04:34.390
Maybe you've been studying too hard.

04:34.390 --> 04:36.490
You have to relax sometimes.

04:38.160 --> 04:39.750
Yes.

04:56.350 --> 04:59.710
-Which school do you wanna go to?
-Huh? Oh...

05:03.020 --> 05:06.510
I'm trying for Tachi High.

05:09.030 --> 05:11.360
I'm trying for Tokutake High.

05:11.360 --> 05:12.400
Hey Tanaka...

05:12.400 --> 05:14.200
-Hit me.
-Huh?

05:14.200 --> 05:18.400
Haven't you wanted to hit me?

05:20.200 --> 05:23.880
Err...Not anymore.

05:23.880 --> 05:24.860
And before?

05:33.050 --> 05:35.220
You can't hit me?

05:35.220 --> 05:36.650
Coward!

05:39.990 --> 05:41.830
What was that?

05:41.830 --> 05:45.060
Your punch is like a girl's.

06:05.680 --> 06:08.020
People who create things

06:08.020 --> 06:11.680
must express their feelings clearly
or it's not good...

06:13.190 --> 06:15.090
My old man used to say that.

06:17.030 --> 06:18.090
So long.

06:22.700 --> 06:23.760
Hyodo-kun!

06:27.370 --> 06:28.800
See you around.

06:30.710 --> 06:31.800
Yeah.

06:42.150 --> 06:46.520
As expected, Momoko-sensei broke
into tears during graduation ceremonies.

07:05.180 --> 07:09.510
And high school entrance exams
ended without much fanfare.

07:11.180 --> 07:13.180
Yukio!

07:13.180 --> 07:16.180
Hurry or you'll be late
for the entrance ceremony!

07:17.360 --> 07:19.190
I know!

07:29.870 --> 07:30.200
"Private Ichieda Academy
Senior High School"

07:30.200 --> 07:35.040
"Private Ichieda Academy
Senior High School"

07:30.200 --> 07:35.040
From today, you are students
of Ichieda Academy

07:35.040 --> 07:39.140
here to study,
participate in sports and clubs.

07:39.140 --> 07:44.810
Osamu Kido, whose mentor,
Karl Goch, treated like a son...

07:51.820 --> 07:51.990
"Anime Research Society"

07:51.990 --> 07:56.260
"Anime Research Society"

07:51.990 --> 07:56.260
Hey, you seem like one of our kind.

07:56.260 --> 07:58.800
"Anime Research Society"

07:56.260 --> 07:58.800
No thanks. I don't intend to join a club.

07:58.800 --> 07:59.000
No thanks. I don't intend to join a club.

07:59.000 --> 08:01.170
Hey Koyuki!

08:01.170 --> 08:03.330
Hey Saku!

08:03.330 --> 08:05.840
Look at your hair!

08:05.840 --> 08:08.340
Well, I'm in high school now,
so I changed it.

08:08.340 --> 08:10.680
Don't go trying to look sexy.

08:10.680 --> 08:11.370
Huh?

08:13.180 --> 08:15.010
Lemme at you!

08:15.010 --> 08:16.850
-Hah!
-Hey!

08:16.850 --> 08:19.720
Shaddup! Trying to act grown-up!

08:19.720 --> 08:21.690
It's 100 years too early, kid!

08:21.690 --> 08:24.660
Hey, that's mean, Chiba-kun! Stop it!

08:30.030 --> 08:34.100
Geez! It took me an hour this morning.

08:34.100 --> 08:35.860
Huh? One hour?

08:38.640 --> 08:42.970
Senpai! I'm just not good
at signing up members!

08:42.970 --> 08:47.140
Shut up! If our activities end up
in the red, it'll be your fault!

08:47.140 --> 08:50.310
Moreover...the sign-up fee is too high.

08:50.310 --> 08:53.150
-Umm...
-Huh?
-Huh?

08:55.650 --> 08:57.320
Umm...Kikata-kun...

08:57.320 --> 08:59.720
You should give up already.

09:01.160 --> 09:04.300
Yusuke, he's the one...

09:04.300 --> 09:06.200
Yeah, I know.

09:12.170 --> 09:14.000
He just up and left...

09:14.000 --> 09:17.010
-I guess we'll be going, too...
-Hey!

09:17.010 --> 09:19.510
You're Yukio Tanaka,
the sophomore in Group 4?

09:19.510 --> 09:23.010
You'll pass out tickets in his place.

09:23.010 --> 09:25.350
Why me?

09:34.190 --> 09:36.890
Uh! Yeah!

09:40.800 --> 09:42.800
You open up the door with negative aura

09:42.800 --> 09:45.000
-Saku and I finished our entrance exams

09:42.800 --> 09:45.000
-You open up the door with negative aura

09:45.000 --> 09:46.140
-and we'll be concentrating
100% on the band.

09:45.000 --> 09:46.140
-You say future is murky indeed...

09:46.140 --> 09:49.110
-and we'll be concentrating
100% on the band.

09:46.140 --> 09:49.110
-I'm sick of hearing gripe.

09:49.110 --> 09:50.980
Open up the door with negative aura

09:50.980 --> 09:51.310
-I can't keep practicing
on Saito-san's guitar forever...

09:50.980 --> 09:51.310
-Open up the door with negative aura

09:51.310 --> 09:52.310
-I can't keep practicing
on Saito-san's guitar forever...

09:51.310 --> 09:52.310
-If you never change

09:52.310 --> 09:55.150
-I can't keep practicing
on Saito-san's guitar forever...

09:52.310 --> 09:55.150
-I think there is no way my life fizzle out...

09:55.150 --> 09:58.320
-And I've been wanting my own guitar.

09:55.150 --> 09:58.320
-I think there is no way my life fizzle out...

09:58.320 --> 10:01.320
Oh yeah? Then I'll go
with you to shop around.

10:01.320 --> 10:03.150
There's one I wanna see, too.

10:03.150 --> 10:04.490
Really?

10:04.490 --> 10:06.660
I'll catch up with you later.

10:06.660 --> 10:07.990
What about you guys?

10:07.990 --> 10:09.830
This is all I need.

10:09.830 --> 10:11.160
You being sarcastic?

10:21.170 --> 10:24.510
Say, don't you get nervous
going into a music store?

10:24.510 --> 10:25.810
You'll get used to it.

10:28.510 --> 10:30.710
So, what are you after?

10:34.190 --> 10:37.120
A Stratocaster...Jaguar...

10:37.120 --> 10:39.460
Jazz Master...

10:39.460 --> 10:41.890
Explorer...SG...

10:43.290 --> 10:45.460
Makes me want all of them!

10:45.460 --> 10:50.970
-This one...a Kayama Yuzo
by Mosrite is good.
-Oh?

10:50.970 --> 10:55.340
No need to rush into it.
We can check out other places.

10:55.340 --> 10:56.600
You're right.

10:58.310 --> 10:59.780
He dissed me!

11:06.820 --> 11:08.150
Umm...

11:08.150 --> 11:11.160
My friends and I are gonna start a band...

11:11.160 --> 11:15.330
We need something called an effector.

11:15.330 --> 11:21.000
Umm...My friend said something like
what Pink Floyd uses might work for us...

11:21.000 --> 11:25.340
Do you even know what an effector is?

11:25.340 --> 11:28.510
Not only that...get real.

11:28.510 --> 11:32.180
You can't produce a sound like
Pink Floyd on a 5000-yen budget.

11:32.180 --> 11:37.680
Oh, it doesn't really
have to be Pink Floyd...

11:37.680 --> 11:39.240
Make up your mind!

11:49.690 --> 11:54.830
Did you see last night's Time Machine?
Van Halen was on.

11:54.830 --> 11:56.200
Yes.

11:56.200 --> 12:02.870
-Ryusuke-kun...That clerk is scary.
-There's no one like them these days...

12:02.870 --> 12:05.380
A lot of 'em are like that.

12:05.380 --> 12:07.040
Excuse me...

12:07.040 --> 12:11.380
I want to try out this
pretty Tiger-eye Les Paul.

12:11.380 --> 12:15.890
Ryusuke-kun...this one says 'ask' on
the tag. How much do you think it is?

12:15.890 --> 12:17.720
1,080,000 yen.

12:17.720 --> 12:18.720
Huh?

12:18.720 --> 12:24.830
That's vintage 1959 Les Paul
made by the legendary Tom Murphy.

12:24.830 --> 12:25.730
Yeah...

12:25.730 --> 12:26.730
Hmm...

12:26.730 --> 12:28.250
Hey, keep your hands off!

12:31.070 --> 12:33.970
I was going to use this as a down payment.

12:35.740 --> 12:37.510
Just a minute...

12:37.510 --> 12:40.510
Ryusuke-kun! How'd you
get so much money?

12:40.510 --> 12:44.570
I was gonna go to the fish farm
after this to buy fish.

12:59.860 --> 13:02.730
Takano-san...Y-You're amazing.

13:11.540 --> 13:14.010
Okay, this guitar is prepped.

13:17.720 --> 13:19.550
Koyuki, play.

13:19.550 --> 13:21.520
Huh? Ryusuke-kun, you play.

13:23.890 --> 13:25.150
Yeah?

13:26.720 --> 13:30.220
Can't get a true sound
if it's wired like this.

13:56.020 --> 13:58.360
H-How is it?

13:58.360 --> 14:00.020
Yeah...so-so.

14:00.020 --> 14:01.860
Hey, Ryusuke.

14:01.860 --> 14:03.360
Huh? Takano-san.

14:03.360 --> 14:06.030
Oh, Taira! It's been awhile.

14:06.030 --> 14:09.030
Damn, your hair has grown.

14:09.030 --> 14:13.540
Ah, this? I know. I used to be bald.

14:13.540 --> 14:17.540
-How's Fire Joker?
-We disbanded last year.

14:17.540 --> 14:19.180
Disbanded?

14:19.180 --> 14:20.840
Yeah...

14:20.840 --> 14:24.580
I was 27 when we formed the band

14:24.580 --> 14:29.020
and I swore I wouldn't cut my
hair until we had a major debut.

14:30.720 --> 14:32.590
-Ah...
-Hmm...

14:34.890 --> 14:36.660
Where's Koyuki?

14:36.660 --> 14:38.500
Huh? Where'd he go?

14:38.500 --> 14:40.160
Weren't you together?

14:40.160 --> 14:42.500
Yeah...for a bit.

14:42.500 --> 14:45.840
Don't badmouth Kenji-san.

14:45.840 --> 14:46.670
Huh?

14:46.670 --> 14:51.180
He may not look it,
but he's tops in maintenance.

14:51.180 --> 14:52.140
'Kay.

15:02.850 --> 15:04.690
Hey, what's up?

15:04.690 --> 15:06.360
Like it?

15:06.360 --> 15:08.360
Try it out.

15:08.360 --> 15:10.190
I feel...

15:10.190 --> 15:14.360
I feel as though the guitar is calling me.

15:14.360 --> 15:15.870
A Telecaster?

15:15.870 --> 15:18.700
But you've got to wonder
what kind of condition it's in.

15:18.700 --> 15:20.200
You're right.

15:20.200 --> 15:21.370
Kenji-san...

15:21.370 --> 15:26.210
Well, if you buy it,
I'll replace the bridge and peg.

15:26.210 --> 15:29.050
Hmm...I'll even replace the pick-up.

15:29.050 --> 15:30.880
Really?

15:30.880 --> 15:32.880
But I...

15:32.880 --> 15:35.220
...don't have the cash.

15:35.220 --> 15:40.660
In the past, Taira came out to help
and really saved me a number of times.

15:40.660 --> 15:45.830
That's not the reason, but I'm
willing to make you a special loan.

15:45.830 --> 15:48.500
Thank you! I'll think about it.

15:48.500 --> 15:50.590
Hey Koyuki...Play it.

16:04.350 --> 16:08.850
G-Geez...I'm embarrassed
to play in front of you three.

16:08.850 --> 16:11.020
Why'd you act so shy?

16:11.020 --> 16:12.420
Well...

16:19.760 --> 16:23.720
"Chinese Restaurant Sing Lung"

16:24.200 --> 16:26.860
-Hurry it up.
-I'm sorry.

16:28.710 --> 16:31.540
Tanaka-kun...The dumplings?

16:31.540 --> 16:33.640
The customer is waiting.

16:35.380 --> 16:38.820
Hey, Tanaka, put your back into it.

16:38.820 --> 16:41.380
-Right!
-Hurry with the spring rolls!

16:48.160 --> 16:50.130
Two more hours.

17:06.840 --> 17:08.740
Ouchie!

17:18.860 --> 17:22.530
Hey part-timer! I'm making
the soup, so crack the eggs.

17:22.530 --> 17:23.990
Oh, right!

17:52.490 --> 17:56.390
In this world, even someone
so amazing couldn't turn pro...

17:58.330 --> 18:02.700
His hair was so long.

18:04.900 --> 18:07.870
"Sant 'Himizu"

18:24.690 --> 18:26.210
Ow...

18:34.870 --> 18:37.060
Huh? If it isn't Tanaka-kun!

18:37.970 --> 18:39.140
What're you doing?

18:39.140 --> 18:41.310
I deliver papers.

18:41.310 --> 18:43.970
By the way, are the tickets selling?

18:43.970 --> 18:46.640
No...I've been busy
with band rehearsals

18:46.640 --> 18:48.150
and haven't done a thing.

18:48.150 --> 18:50.480
Hey, that's bad!

18:50.480 --> 18:52.820
You have to help, too, Kikata-kun!

18:52.820 --> 18:56.190
Oh, I have to deliver
my newspapers. See you!

18:56.190 --> 18:56.950
Huh?

19:15.840 --> 19:17.470
Hey! What's going on?

19:18.680 --> 19:21.510
I told you, I was so busy,
I couldn't sell tickets.

19:21.510 --> 19:22.850
Oh...

19:22.850 --> 19:24.510
Come to the club office.

19:27.020 --> 19:30.610
I warned him! This is bad! This is bad!

19:34.520 --> 19:38.460
Is this club for light music?

19:38.460 --> 19:42.630
-Of course!
-We all have perfect music sense.

19:42.630 --> 19:44.300
Oh...

19:44.300 --> 19:47.500
No, these guys aren't like Hyodo.

19:50.970 --> 19:54.980
It's cool, huh? The Martin D45.

19:54.980 --> 19:55.910
-Huh?
-Huh?
-Huh?

19:57.810 --> 20:01.180
Yeah...it's great. That Marching.

20:02.990 --> 20:04.490
Damn it!

20:04.490 --> 20:07.160
You make me sick, just like Chiba!

20:07.160 --> 20:10.490
-Do you know the Death Valley Bomb?
-No...

20:10.490 --> 20:13.000
-What about Michinoku Driver?
-A little...

20:13.000 --> 20:15.330
-Awright!
-Shiiki!

20:15.330 --> 20:17.670
Chiba-kun!

20:17.670 --> 20:19.190
Saku!

20:24.170 --> 20:26.010
You're pitiful, Shiiki!

20:27.180 --> 20:31.010
You shattered my dream of being
homeroom president three years in a row!

20:31.010 --> 20:36.290
Hey, you've got it wrong!

20:36.290 --> 20:38.960
It's not something I was hoping for...

20:38.960 --> 20:42.460
Our teacher chose based on our grades.

20:42.460 --> 20:45.430
You're the homeroom president?

20:48.800 --> 20:49.970
Listen up, Shiiki...

20:49.970 --> 20:53.830
If you ever lay your hands on Koyuki
or Saku you'll regret it big time.

20:56.810 --> 20:59.980
Sorry...You took some knocks there.

20:59.980 --> 21:02.850
-Nah...
-Umm...

21:02.850 --> 21:04.310
-Huh?
-Huh?
-Huh?

21:04.310 --> 21:08.310
Could you put me on your
list of persons to protect?

21:09.990 --> 21:11.420
Who are you?

21:12.660 --> 21:15.160
I'm hungry! Let's go eat ramen!

21:15.160 --> 21:17.190
-Uh-huh...
-Uh-huh...

21:17.190 --> 21:18.420
Me too.

21:26.170 --> 21:29.470
The other day, some cases of bullets
were sent to me with a letter.

21:31.070 --> 21:31.840
"Fishing Hole"

21:31.840 --> 21:36.040
"Fishing Hole"

21:31.840 --> 21:36.040
Eddy, that sounds so crazy.
You got some manic groupie or somethin'?

21:37.180 --> 21:40.640
No, no...no. I have a bad hunch.

21:43.350 --> 21:45.590
The number of cases
were the same number

21:45.590 --> 21:47.720
as bullet marks on Lucille's body.

21:49.690 --> 21:51.130
Hey that means...

21:54.870 --> 21:56.090
Yeah...

21:57.700 --> 22:01.660
I think...he found out about that.

22:50.380 --> 22:52.480
Another minute

22:52.480 --> 22:55.180
Feelin' so fine

22:57.490 --> 22:59.720
You turn the freeze

22:59.720 --> 23:02.450
into warm light

23:04.560 --> 23:08.030
Had a premonition

23:08.030 --> 23:10.700
I've been waitin' ever since

23:10.700 --> 23:14.200
My world comin' down

23:14.200 --> 23:17.000
It's got me spinnin' 'round

23:18.770 --> 23:24.950
If you really wanna fly

23:24.950 --> 23:27.710
you gotta let go

23:39.960 --> 23:42.300
Simply the most

23:42.300 --> 23:44.330
big sensation

23:44.330 --> 23:47.140
(once you're here you won't go back)

23:47.140 --> 23:49.400
She's really pretty

23:49.400 --> 23:51.410
One-eyed vision

23:51.410 --> 23:54.240
(lose the fear it don't come back)

23:54.240 --> 23:57.750
Little sister showed me

23:57.750 --> 24:00.420
Really took me for a ride

24:00.420 --> 24:02.080
My world comin' down

24:02.080 --> 24:05.420
(once you're here you won't go back)

24:05.420 --> 24:09.450
(lose the fear it don't come back)

24:13.500 --> 24:16.300
Wash your face and take the challenge!

24:16.300 --> 24:17.170
"Live 16 'Indies'"

24:16.300 --> 24:17.170
Wash your face and take the challenge!

24:17.170 --> 24:20.230
"Live 16 'Indies'"

24:17.170 --> 24:20.230
Paul Newman is so cool!
I wanna be a hustler, too!
